{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/1/98172d1b54b563033d26dc22c407dad4d4802be5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. The equation with roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/232940ffba12c6c483022e1613af7018ad673365.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ar+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/9/2197482deadbf68d1cb0d16e7fa920f0e882b040.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$as+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/7/497cfe432a5d77b3975a7d8f0a216d5cf7786728.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ x^2-bx-ac=0\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ x^2-bx+ac=0 \\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ x^2+3bx+ca+2b^2=0 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ x^2+3bx-ca+2b^2=0 \\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ x^2+bx(2-a)+a^2c+b^2(a+1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"475\" height=\"59\" />    \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/4/584725b65939e4a58caf8f0a4673a8e09f9c35eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r+s=\\frac{-b}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"87\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/e/0ee2b9209841b8ecd9dcccefbdccbb8560acbe85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$rs=\\frac{c}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"53\" height=\"33\" /> in the original quadratic.\n</p><p>The sum of the roots in the new quadratic is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/2/cb23892430692d279f38d8fbaaf1bafe91c94fa8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ar + b + as + b\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e591e6b17bf04075dd14dca4d2f25225c49780a5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a(r+s) + 2b\\]\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/5/5a5f93fac750bf95280cef09b39fd2f984c1ad43.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b\\]\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\" />\nThe product of the roots in the new quadratic is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/7/c174734d005443b11a0f46c4d6f6ebe682820a4f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(ar + b)(as + b)\\]\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/9/109206ff957e7cabdb68b893d434a5310a750a0f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2rs + arb + asb + b^2\\]\" width=\"166\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/5/c555eea05864a2ca1567bb1f943abe9e8a997fd2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2rs + ab(r+s) + b^2\\]\" width=\"163\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/d/efdc0630933f244e3746bf13b97614db286c286d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ac - b^2 + b^2\\]\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/f/30f7f14659c2613709027130a6a78cb10090cccd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ac\\]\" width=\"17\" height=\"8\" />\nThus, the new quadratic is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b131f13ec6daf618625f31d29fd092c6f47ffb6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-bx+ac$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />.  The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/9/28969a57466b0a1047fca37478da706c1cb8cced.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"157\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> be the desired function with roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/232940ffba12c6c483022e1613af7018ad673365.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ar+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/9/2197482deadbf68d1cb0d16e7fa920f0e882b040.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$as+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" />. Applying graphical transformations, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/7/187b189aae47e95ac872507d1a395c07354e4d57.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(r)=f(s)=0\\]\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/3/f43782e25cf39e3764db05464857b921b15052ba.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(\\frac{(ar+b)-b}{a})=f(\\frac{(as+b)-b}{a})=0\\]\" width=\"299\" height=\"38\" />\nThus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/232940ffba12c6c483022e1613af7018ad673365.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ar+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/9/2197482deadbf68d1cb0d16e7fa920f0e882b040.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$as+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" /> are the roots to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/f/93f82f1f847553482cc83c7be4ba0176dfee65bc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[g(x)=f(\\frac{x-b}{a})\\]\" width=\"126\" height=\"37\" />\nPlugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39cdced5e4af2b2ec78c6c53c0028d7c96bd28d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{x-b}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"77\" height=\"37\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/b/e7b77b8e1df10e9b8c053ef67e2d857294d5d856.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)=x^2-bx+ac \\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"182\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p>~ Nafer\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" 